p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> not potato<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> not potato<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> It should be able to run on most modern windows devices</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> not potato<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> not potato<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> It should be able to run on most modern windows devices</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Monchii Studio"],"publishers":["Monchii Studio"],"release_date":"Aug 27, 2026"}